The paper’s hard construction is exact: Lemma `vd-basic-aea` turns Set Cover into deletion for the fixed sentence “every vertex has an incident edge lying in no triangle.” A purely random planted exact cover would pass search-hardness probes but would violate the no-tool effort cap, so I’m instead testing a Track B specialization: the Set Cover instance is a regular bipartite perfect-matching instance whose affine decomposition is short to recognize, while the honest reference algorithm is polynomial matching.
