1912-<p id="S4.p5.3" class="ltx_p">Comparing this with (<a href="#S3.E1" title="In Upper Bounds ‣ 3 Basic Graphs ‣ On the Descriptive Complexity of Vertex Deletion Problems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>) from the proof of
