+        "is 'a:u:v' or 'b:u:v' with 0 <= u < v < 2p and {u,v} one of the "
+        "displayed 2-sets.  Labels are ordered by (u,v,side), and exactly one "
+        "displayed set incident with each left-shore element is selected."
+    ),
+    "bounds": {
