+        "this 2-set regime is solved by Hopcroft-Karp in O(m*sqrt(p)); at the "
+        "shipping preset its measured wall time and edge inspections are "
+        "reported by selftest, whereas the affine route uses at most 253 exact "
+        "arithmetic operations."
