Built and locally verified a Track B generator based on the paper’s Lemma 3.14 Set Cover reduction.

Files:

- [gen_2406_18299.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2406.18299/gen_2406_18299.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2406.18299/selftest_report.json)
