    $C = \{s_1\}$ is not a set cover as $v$ is not covered and,
    indeed, all four incident edges of~$v_1$ (namely $s_2 \adj' v_1$,
    $s_2' \adj' v_1$, $s_3\adj' v_1$, and $s_3'\adj' v_1$) are part of
