  \begin{align} 
    G \setminus D^s \models \forall x\exists y\bigl(((s = x) \to \phi_1(s,
    x, y)) \land ((s \neq x) \to \phi_2(s, x, y))\bigr). \label{eq-d}
  \end{align}
  The algorithm will consider this particular $s$ at some point in
