All local gates pass, including 0/200,000 random hits, four attacks at 0/8, direct first-order verification cross-checks, and canonical-key invariance. The 113-label answer is 1,247 characters, with a 245-operation intended route.

It is not submission-ready: every OpenRouter attempt returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded,” leaving zero deciding oracle attempts. This is recorded honestly; no hardness verdict or rejection was manufactured.
